{
  "id": "wanpe_cinematic_prompt_enhancement",
  "title": "WanPE Cinematic Prompt Planning",
  "category": "benchmark_news",
  "domain_taxonomy": "quantitative_benchmark",
  "hook_tag": "CINEMATIC PROMPT PLANNING",
  "beats": [
    {
      "beat_id": 1,
      "text": "How do we turn a short prompt into a thirty-second movie? It starts by solving the mystery of what the camera should do next.",
      "visual_focus": "A blank screen suddenly populating with a branching storyboard of movie scenes.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "thirty-second": "#F59E0B",
        "mystery": "#38BDF8"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Prompt Enhancer",
        "action_verb": "maps",
        "direct_object": "Cinematic Storyboard",
        "anchor_word": "movie",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 2,
      "text": "It is like a director guessing the whole play from one word. Without guidance, the AI gets lost in a sea of messy choices.",
      "visual_focus": "A single word exploding into a tangled, chaotic cloud of conflicting film styles.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "messy choices": "#EF4444"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Raw Prompt",
        "action_verb": "diffuses",
        "direct_object": "Ambiguous Latent Space",
        "anchor_word": "choices",
        "semantic_role": "state_transition"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 3,
      "text": "WanPE fixes this by looking at real films backwards. It chips away at scenes to find the perfect map for a director to use.",
      "visual_focus": "A sculptor carving a clay figure labeled 'Shot Plan' from a solid block of grey data.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "backwards": "#34D399",
        "perfect map": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Reverse Constructor",
        "action_verb": "projects",
        "direct_object": "Shot-level Plan",
        "anchor_word": "map",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 4,
      "text": "The model uses tiny logic gates to keep the story flow on track. It tests every shot to make sure it matches your goal.",
      "visual_focus": "A series of green gates swinging open or shut as a stream of data tokens flows through them.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "logic gates": "#F59E0B",
        "on track": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Semantic Gate",
        "action_verb": "filters",
        "direct_object": "Sequence Coherence",
        "anchor_word": "gates",
        "semantic_role": "causal_elimination"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 5,
      "text": "The result is a fifty point jump in human preference. It is clear that better planning makes for much better video output today.",
      "visual_focus": "Two bar charts comparing, with the WanPE bar leaping far above the baseline.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "fifty point jump": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "WanPE",
        "action_verb": "surpasses",
        "direct_object": "Human Preference Metric",
        "anchor_word": "jump",
        "semantic_role": "metric_evaluation"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 6,
      "text": "Follow The Model Verse for simple explanations of how modern AI actually works.",
      "visual_focus": "A sleek logo animation with the text 'The Model Verse' appearing on a clean dark background.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "The Model Verse": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Viewer",
        "action_verb": "follows",
        "direct_object": "The Model Verse",
        "anchor_word": "Follow",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      }
    }
  ],
